@startuml
actor User
boundary LoginPage
control AuthController
control AuthService
database Database
entity Dashboard

User -> LoginPage: Enter username/email and password
User -> LoginPage: Click "Login" button
LoginPage -> AuthController: POST /api/login
AuthController -> AuthService: Validate credentials
AuthService -> Database: Verify user credentials
Database --> AuthService: Return user details and authentication status
AuthService --> AuthController: Return authentication result and token
AuthController --> LoginPage: Return authentication result and token
LoginPage -> User: Display appropriate message and redirect to dashboard if successful
User -> Dashboard: Access personalized dashboard
@enduml
